Bedtime:
- For each girl bed, interact at center+50 y. Dialog "Tuck X in"; click "Goodnight, time to settle in."; if fails, offerBedParenting opens; click calm until success; then wait tasks.bedX (route arrival). Set girl speed 200. But after dinner, girls may be at table or wandering. Route to bed. Wait.
- Note task order: after dinner, all taskOrder done. Bed tasks allowed. Good.
