Test additions:
After "repeat calls do not farm girl moods", add cycling test:
```
await page.evaluate(() => __game.sendGirlsInside());
const beforeReCall = await state(); const beforeReMoods=(await girls()).map...
await page.evaluate(() => __game.callGirlsOutside());
const reCall = await state(); ...
assert(reCall.girlsOutside && reCall.outsidePlayBonus===beforeReCall.outsidePlayBonus)
assert moods unchanged (<1)
```
But note after sendGirlsInside, the toast etc. Then call. Also assert sandboxPlayed remains false? At this point we haven't played sandbox yet, so sandboxPlayed false. After re-call, still false, fine. To test sandbox not reset after completed, do this cycling test AFTER sandbox play instead. Better sequence:
- after sandbox repeat guard, send inside, call again, assert bonus/moods unchanged and sandboxPlayed remains true; then playInSandbox toast says already had time.
- But we then need to reset player near sandbox and interact? We can call `playInSandbox()` directly and check toast.
- Then fetch tests (fetch unaffected).
Let's insert after sandbox repeat block:

```
await page.evaluate(() => { __game.sendGirlsInside(); });
const cycleBefore = await state();
const cycleMoods = (await girls()).map(g=>g.mood);
await page.evaluate(() => __game.callGirlsOutside());
await page.waitForTimeout(120);
const cycleAfter = await state();
const cycleMoodsAfter = (await girls()).map(g=>g.mood);
assert(cycleAfter.girlsOutside, 'the girls can come back outside');
assert(cycleAfter.outsidePlayBonus === cycleBefore.outsidePlayBonus, 're-calling after sending them inside cannot farm boosts');
assert(cycleMoodsAfter.every(...), '...moods');
await page.evaluate(() => __game.playInSandbox());
await page.waitForTimeout(100);
assert(/already had their sandbox time/i.test(await toast()), 'sandbox stays used for the whole backyard trip');
```
But after `sendGirlsInside`, the girls positions = 820,340; callGirlsOutside positions to 470. Fine.
Mood passive drift <1 in 120ms. Good.

Note: assert callBoostUsed maybe. Add `assert(cycleAfter.callBoostUsed === true, 'outside call boost is once per trip')`.

Then fetch. Good.

Insert before fetch section.

