54: <div class="intro-shade" id="introShade"><div class="intro-card"><h1>Morning Mayhem</h1><p>It’s Tuesday morning, and the house is already waking up. Help Dad guide the family through a very busy day.</p><p class="objective"><strong>Your goal:</strong> complete every chore in order: make breakfast (with all three girls seated), get everyone showered and ready, wash and dry the laundry, make lunch, do the dishes, enjoy afternoon activities, and make dinner. Then tuck Elaina, Elsie, and Ellerle into bed and get Dad into his own bed to win. Keep your temper from running out along the way—take a dad break or grab coffee when focus dips.</p><p>Move with <strong>WASD</strong> or the arrow keys, or use the on-screen control pad. Press <strong>E</strong> near a station to interact, or tap the green action button on a phone.</p><button id="startGame">Start game</button></div></div>
